== Notes ==
* In several normal rooms, Headless Horseman's head appears on his own without his body.
** Two or three of Headless Horseman's heads can be found in the same normal rooms.

== Trivia ==
* Headless Horseman appeared in the original ''The Binding of Isaac.''
* The [[wikipedia:Headless Horseman|Headless Horseman]] originated from European folklore during the Middle Ages but gained popularity in America with ''[[wikipedia:The Legend of Sleepy Hollow|The Legend of Sleepy Hollow]]'', a short story written in 1820 by American author [[wikipedia:Washington Irving|Washington Irving]], in which the Headless Horseman was prominently featured.
* The boss art shows the head with both eyes, even though its in-game sprite only has one.
* The boss art shows the horse's head as brown, even though its in-game sprite is black.
* {{dlc|a+}} The Delirium version of Headless Horseman's horse resembles {{e|Famine}}'s horse rather than Headless Horseman's.

